cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CIS2HDL: OrCAD Capture CIS to Cadence Design Entry HDL Schematic Converter (DSN edition)"
abstract: >-
  CIS2HDL converts OrCAD Capture CIS schematics into Cadence Design Entry HDL
  (Concept HDL) projects, reading the binary DSN database as the single source of
  truth. It reproduces component geometry, routes every instance through one of six
  matching outcomes (exact, fuzzy, mock, non-electrical, GND, connector), lays out
  and wires the schematic, and emits a complete Design Entry HDL project tree with a
  generated symbol library, a mapping table, and a golden comparison against
  independently exported reference data.
